---
InheritParentConfig: true
# - Qt Test discovers test functions as private slots, so they can't be static.
# - Every QVERIFY/QCOMPARE expands to an `if`, so straight-line tests score as
#   "complex".
# - QFETCH declares non-const locals.
Checks: >
  -readability-convert-member-functions-to-static,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -misc-const-correctness
